Times for Claude Sonnet 5.5 (low reasoning), GPT-6 Astra (low reasoning, 16 per request), Claude Opus 5.5 (low reasoning, 16 per request) and
Claude Sonnet 5.5 (high reasoning, 16 per request) were measured on a sample (200 questions), over 5 repeat runs.
Times for Laya multilingual, Laya, Decider v1, Jev 1.13, Liquid d1, Open Jev, Qwen 3.8 27B (yes/no score) and Qwen 3.8 27B (written estimate)
come from later repeat runs on all questions.
§ Estimated at the maker's list price for the same model; our hardware cost is not measured.
